flowchart TB
 IN[Webhook update] --> DEDUP[DB unique update_id]
 DEDUP --> Q[Durable job / outbox]
 Q --> CLAIM[Worker claim SKIP LOCKED]
 CLAIM --> EXEC[Execute with deadline / rate limit]
 EXEC -->|success| DONE[Commit outcome + metrics]
 EXEC -->|transient error| RETRY[Bounded retries + backoff]
 RETRY --> Q
 EXEC -->|permanent error| DLQ[Failed jobs / admin review]
 DB[(PostgreSQL)] --> BACKUP[Daily backup + restore drill]
 STORE[(MinIO)] --> BACKUP
 METRICS[Latency / queue age / token cost / failures] --> ALERT[Alerts / dashboard]
 EXEC --> METRICS
